        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International CP-671, Trumbull Cabinet Door Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nVery little in door hardware has the versatility of the Trumbull Cabinet Pull. It is available in an array finishes and each one of them seem to transform this cabinet handle into something different. The cafe bronze finish gives the impression of leather for a rustic feel while the two-toned polished nickel and black grants this cabinet door pull a very on-trend look perfect for modern spaces. Part of RK International's Trumbull Collection, this cabinet door pull is available in 3 sizes: 4-1/2 inches, 5-1/2 inches, and 8-1/2 inches. It comes packaged with all the necessary installation hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: <a href=\"/products/trumbull-cabinet-knob-rk-international-ck-171\"><b>Trumbull Cabinet Knob</b></a> and  <a href=\"/products/trumbull-appliance-pull-rk-international-ap-ph-6671\"><b>Trumbull Appliance Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>CP-671:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 96 mm</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 4-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-7/32\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>CP-672:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 5-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-7/32\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>CP-673:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 8-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/OMN-12-specifications.gif?v=1704354508\" width=\"573\" height=\"107\" border=\"0\" alt=\"RKI Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
