                "description": "RK International CP-671, Trumbull Cabinet Pull - Very little in door hardware has the versatility of the Trumbull Cabinet Pull. It is available in 7 finishes and each one of them seem to transform this cabinet handle into something different. The cafe bronze finish gives the impression of leather for a rustic feel while the two-toned polished nickel and black grants this cabinet door pull a very on-trend look perfect for modern spaces. Part of RK International's Trumbull Collection, this cabinet door pull is available in 3 sizes: 4-1/2 inches, 5-1/2 inches, and 8-1/2 inches.",
